      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Rehoboamu yaatuma mu Baisiraeli Adoramu eyali akulira abo abaasaliranga abantu abaakolanga emirimo egy'olukako amakatala. Aye Abaisiraeli baamukuba amabaale, baamwita. Agho kyabazinga Rehoboamu yaayangugha, yaaniina ekigaali kye eky'omu lutalo, yaalumukira e Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuva n'olwo, Abaisiraeli ab'omu kiketezo eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba wa Isiraeli, baadheema okufugibwa ab'endhu ya Daudi ni ye buli eno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
